    "Group A: every model in Studies A and B of this project (ten models, six template lineages expected).",
    "Group B: open-weight models used as the agent or probe model in the closest literature read for the 2026-11 audit (ChatInject, ToolHazard, Role Confusion, Silent Failures, the serving-stack confounds paper, Yu et al.), one checkpoint per named family and size class.",
    "Group C: the Study R candidates not already in A or B.",
    "One repository per model. Where the official repository is gated, an ungated mirror is used and recorded as a mirror; the official template was not read.",
    "Revisions are pinned to the commit that was current on 2026-11-15."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "This is not a random or popularity-weighted sample of the Hub. It is the set of models this project and its closest literature have made claims about.",
    "Hosted, closed models are out of reach: their rendering cannot be observed.",
